Dear Secretary of State,

I write to notify you that Judicial Review proceedings have been issued and=
 served in the matter Zahmoul v Secretary of State for Justice & HMCTS (AC-2=
025-LON-004293).

The claim concerns:
=E2=80=A2 the alleged misadministration of court-controlled electronic material w=
ith potential criminal relevance, and
=E2=80=A2 systemic administrative failures within HMCTS which affected the partic=
ipation of a vulnerable litigant.

Given your role as Secretary of State for Justice and named defendant in th=
ese proceedings, I provide this update for transparency.

A public archive of officially filed documents is available at:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours sincerely,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

